      ******************************************************************
      *  CBTRN02C.cut -- COBOL-CHECK TESTSUITE
      *
      *  Testsuite : CBTRN02C TRANSACTION POSTING VALIDATION
      *  Program-under-test : app/cbl/CBTRN02C.cbl
      *
      *  Exercises CBTRN02C -- the daily transaction-posting batch
      *  program -- with all external file-I/O virtualised by
      *  cobol-check 0.2.16's READ/WRITE-stripping pass.  Each
      *  TESTCASE PERFORMs a production paragraph LIVE; only the
      *  external CALL 'CEE3ABD' boundary is mocked.
      *
      *  cobol-check 0.2.16 limitations honored
      *  --------------------------------------
      *  - File-I/O verbs collapse to CONTINUE; tests pre-MOVE the
      *    relevant *-STATUS field to drive production IF arms.
      *  - READ INVALID KEY and REWRITE INVALID KEY orphan bodies
      *    execute UNCONDITIONALLY because the framework strips
      *    READ/REWRITE to CONTINUE and the runner-script awk pass
      *    comments out only the INVALID KEY clause-opener.  This
      *    has two testable consequences:
      *      a. PERFORM 1500-A-LOOKUP-XREF unconditionally executes
      *         the line-385 orphan MOVE 100 TO WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-
      *         REASON.  TC1 / TC2 assert this directly.
      *      b. PERFORM 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT unconditionally executes
      *         BOTH the line-397 INVALID KEY orphan MOVE 101 AND
      *         the lines 403-420 NOT INVALID KEY orphan body
      *         (COMPUTE WS-TEMP-BAL, IF credit-limit, IF expiration).
      *         Final reason is 101 by default; 102 if credit-limit
      *         fails (TC4); 103 if expiration fails (TC5, overrides
      *         102).  Pre-MOVE DALYTRAN-AMT or DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS
      *         drives the IF guards.
      *  - 1500-VALIDATE-TRAN umbrella cascade (line 372 IF reason=0
      *    PERFORM 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT) halts at reason=100 from
      *    1500-A under stripping, so 1500-B is SKIPPED.  TC1 names
      *    are aligned with this limitation: TC1 description is
      *    "1500-VALIDATE-TRAN cascade halts on first XREF failure"
      *    rather than "happy path", reflecting actual behaviour.
      *
      *  External dependency mocked: CALL 'CEE3ABD' (LE abend),
      *  Local-scope per-TESTCASE.  The runtime stub at tests/stubs/
      *  CEE3ABD.cbl is linked into the merged binary as a backstop.
      *
      *  Reject codes (production literals; not recomputed)
      *  --------------------------------------------------
      *    100 -- production line 385 (1500-A-LOOKUP-XREF orphan)
      *    101 -- production line 397 (1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT orphan)
      *    102 -- production line 410 (1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT IF ELSE
      *           overlimit)
      *    103 -- production line 417 (1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT IF ELSE
      *           expired)
      *    109 -- production line 556 (2800-UPDATE-ACCOUNT-REC
      *           REWRITE INVALID KEY orphan)
      *
      *  Test categories (12 testcases)
      *  ------------------------------
      *    TC1  - 1500-VALIDATE-TRAN cascade halts on first XREF
      *           failure (orphan body sets reason=100, gate stops
      *           cascade so 1500-B is not reached)
      *    TC2  - 1500-A-LOOKUP-XREF missing XREF reject 100
      *    TC3  - 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT missing ACCT reject 101
      *    TC4  - 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT credit limit reject 102
      *           (PERFORMs 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT directly)
      *    TC5  - 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT expired acct reject 103
      *           (PERFORMs 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT directly)
      *    TC6  - 2500-WRITE-REJECT-REC writes rejected
      *    TC7  - 2900-WRITE-TRANSACTION-FILE writes valid
      *    TC8  - 2800-UPDATE-ACCOUNT-REC reason 109 (REWRITE
      *           INVALID KEY orphan body under stripping)
      *    TC9  - 2700-B-UPDATE-TCATBAL-REC existing rec rewrites
      *    TC10 - 2700-A-CREATE-TCATBAL-REC writes new
      *    TC11 - reject count gt 0 RC 4 transition (precondition
      *           preserved by 2500-WRITE-REJECT-REC; main-paragraph
      *           IF guard at production line 229 is unreachable
      *           via PERFORM <name> but its precondition is verified)
      *    TC12 - 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM invokes CEE3ABD stub
      *
      *  References
      *  ----------
      *    AAP Sections 0.4.3, 0.5.1, 0.5.2, 0.7.1, 0.10.1, 0.10.2
      *    app/cbl/CBTRN02C.cbl                (program under test)
      *    tests/stubs/STUB-ABEND-FLAG.cpy / CEE3ABD.cbl
      *    tests/cobol-check/CSUTLDTC.cut      (canonical exemplar)
      *    tests/cobol-check/CBTRN01C.cut / CBTRN03C.cut
      *    tests/fixtures/cobol-snippets/{DALYTRAN,XREF,ACCT,TCATBAL}-FIXTURE-001.cpy
      ******************************************************************

       TESTSUITE 'CBTRN02C TRANSACTION POSTING VALIDATION'.

      ******************************************************************
      *  BEFORE-EACH -- per-testcase isolation reset.
      *  Clears 6 file-status fields, IO-STATUS overlays, all 5
      *  record buffers (DALYTRAN/TRAN/XREF/ACCT/TCATBAL), the
      *  WS-VALIDATION-TRAILER, EOF + reject-count + abend flags +
      *  RETURN-CODE.  cobol-check resets MOCK counters automatically.
      ******************************************************************
       BEFORE-EACH
            INITIALIZE DALYTRAN-STATUS
            INITIALIZE TRANFILE-STATUS
            INITIALIZE XREFFILE-STATUS
            INITIALIZE DALYREJS-STATUS
            INITIALIZE ACCTFILE-STATUS
            INITIALIZE TCATBALF-STATUS
            INITIALIZE IO-STATUS
            INITIALIZE IO-STATUS-04
            INITIALIZE APPL-RESULT
            INITIALIZE ABCODE
            INITIALIZE TIMING
            INITIALIZE DALYTRAN-RECORD
            INITIALIZE TRAN-RECORD
            INITIALIZE CARD-XREF-RECORD
            INITIALIZE ACCOUNT-RECORD
            INITIALIZE TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD
            INITIALIZE WS-VALIDATION-TRAILER
            MOVE 'N' TO END-OF-FILE
            MOVE 0   TO WS-REJECT-COUNT
            MOVE 'N' TO WS-ABEND-FLAG
            MOVE 0   TO WS-ABEND-CODE
            MOVE 0   TO RETURN-CODE
       END-BEFORE.

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC1 -- 1500-VALIDATE-TRAN cascade halts on first XREF failure.
      *  PERFORMs umbrella 1500-VALIDATE-TRAN; under stripping the
      *  1500-A INVALID KEY orphan sets reason=100; the line-372
      *  cascade gate then evaluates 100!=0 and SKIPS 1500-B.
      *  Asserts cascade post-state validates first-failure-stops
      *  behaviour.  Reason 100 is from production line 385.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 1500-VALIDATE-TRAN halts cascade on XREF fail'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 1500-VALIDATE-TRAN
            EXPECT WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON TO BE 100
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC2 -- 1500-A-LOOKUP-XREF missing XREF reject 100.
      *  Under stripping, the INVALID KEY orphan body executes
      *  unconditionally (production line 385: MOVE 100).
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 1500-A-LOOKUP-XREF missing XREF reject 100'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 1500-A-LOOKUP-XREF
            EXPECT WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON TO BE 100
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC3 -- 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT missing ACCT reject 101.
      *  Under stripping, both INVALID KEY (line 397: MOVE 101) and
      *  NOT INVALID KEY orphans execute.  With BEFORE-EACH zero/
      *  spaces baseline, COMPUTE WS-TEMP-BAL=0, credit IF passes
      *  (no override), expiration IF passes (no override).  Final
      *  reason = 101.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT missing ACCT reject 101'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT
            EXPECT WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON TO BE 101
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC4 -- 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT credit-limit exceeded reject 102.
      *  Test author selects DALYTRAN-AMT=99999999.99 from EXTERNAL
      *  knowledge that PIC S9(09)V99 max is +/-999999999.99 and
      *  that ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT (BEFORE-EACH zero) will be exceeded
      *  by any positive DALYTRAN-AMT.  Test does NOT compute
      *  threshold.  Production COMPUTE at line 403 executes during
      *  PERFORM, line-410 IF ELSE -> reason=102.  Expiration check
      *  passes (no override).  Reason 102 from production line 410.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT credit limit reject 102'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE 99999999.99 TO DALYTRAN-AMT
            PERFORM 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT
            EXPECT WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON TO BE 102
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC5 -- 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT expired account reject 103.
      *  Test author selects DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS '99991231...' (year
      *  9999 = COBOL CCYY upper bound, exceeds any realistic
      *  expiration).  ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE = '          ' (BEFORE-
      *  EACH spaces, PIC X(10)).  Alphanumeric compare:
      *    '          ' < '99991231  ' -> line-414 IF false -> ELSE
      *  arm sets reason=103 (overrides earlier 101 from INVALID KEY
      *  orphan; credit-limit check passes with zero balances).
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT expired acct reject 103'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '99991231                  ' TO DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS
            PERFORM 1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT
            EXPECT WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON TO BE 103
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC6 -- 2500-WRITE-REJECT-REC writes rejected (status '00').
      *  Production line 454 IF '00' MOVE 0 TO APPL-RESULT.  No
      *  abend (APPL-AOK CONTINUE branch).
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 2500-WRITE-REJECT-REC writes rejected'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE 100  TO WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON
            MOVE '00' TO DALYREJS-STATUS
            PERFORM 2500-WRITE-REJECT-REC
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC7 -- 2900-WRITE-TRANSACTION-FILE writes valid (status '00').
      *  Production line 569 IF '00' MOVE 0 TO APPL-RESULT.  No abend.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 2900-WRITE-TRANSACTION-FILE writes valid'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TRANFILE-STATUS
            PERFORM 2900-WRITE-TRANSACTION-FILE
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC8 -- 2800-UPDATE-ACCOUNT-REC orphan-body reason 109.
      *  Under cobol-check 0.2.16 stripping, the REWRITE INVALID
      *  KEY orphan body unconditionally executes line 556 MOVE 109.
      *  No abend (paragraph has no PERFORM 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM).
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 2800-UPDATE-ACCOUNT-REC reason 109'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 2800-UPDATE-ACCOUNT-REC
            EXPECT WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON TO BE 109
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC9 -- 2700-B-UPDATE-TCATBAL-REC existing rec rewrites.
      *  PERFORMs 2700-B-UPDATE-TCATBAL-REC directly to bypass the
      *  umbrella 2700-UPDATE-TCATBAL paragraph (which under
      *  stripping always routes to 2700-A-CREATE-TCATBAL-REC due
      *  to the orphan INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' to WS-CREATE-TRANCAT-
      *  REC).  Status='00' drives line-530 SUCCESS branch.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 2700-B-UPDATE-TCATBAL-REC rewrites existing'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TCATBALF-STATUS
            PERFORM 2700-B-UPDATE-TCATBAL-REC
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC10 -- 2700-A-CREATE-TCATBAL-REC writes new (status '00').
      *  Production line 514 IF '00' MOVE 0 TO APPL-RESULT.  No abend.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 2700-A-CREATE-TCATBAL-REC writes new'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '00' TO TCATBALF-STATUS
            PERFORM 2700-A-CREATE-TCATBAL-REC
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC11 -- reject-count > 0 RC=4 precondition preserved.
      *  The production main-paragraph IF guard at line 229
      *  (IF WS-REJECT-COUNT > 0 MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE) lives in
      *  the un-named PROCEDURE DIVISION main body, NOT a callable
      *  paragraph.  cobol-check's UT-INITIALIZE runs only the named
      *  testcase via PERFORM, so the IF guard cannot be reached
      *  via PERFORM <paragraph-name>.
      *
      *  Test strategy: validate the PRECONDITION (WS-REJECT-COUNT
      *  remains > 0 after a reject is written) by exercising 2500-
      *  WRITE-REJECT-REC and asserting WS-REJECT-COUNT = 1.  Under
      *  stripping the reject-write paragraph is not destructive of
      *  the counter; the precondition for the main-paragraph
      *  RC=4 transition is therefore preserved end-to-end.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C reject count gt 0 RC 4 precondition'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE 1    TO WS-REJECT-COUNT
            MOVE '00' TO DALYREJS-STATUS
            PERFORM 2500-WRITE-REJECT-REC
            EXPECT WS-REJECT-COUNT TO BE 1
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC12 -- 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM directly invokes CEE3ABD stub.
      *  Production wrapper (lines 707-711): MOVE 0 TO TIMING,
      *  MOVE 999 TO ABCODE, CALL 'CEE3ABD'.  Sentinel pre-state
      *  (TIMING=8888, ABCODE=7777) verifies production MOVEs ran.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN02C 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM invokes CEE3ABD stub'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE 7777 TO ABCODE
            MOVE 8888 TO TIMING
            PERFORM 9999-ABEND-PROGRAM
            EXPECT ABCODE TO BE 999
            EXPECT TIMING TO BE 0
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

      ******************************************************************
      *  End of testsuite CBTRN02C TRANSACTION POSTING VALIDATION.
      *  Coverage: 12 testcases exercise 9 production paragraphs
      *  (1500-VALIDATE-TRAN umbrella, 1500-A-LOOKUP-XREF,
      *  1500-B-LOOKUP-ACCT, 2500-WRITE-REJECT-REC, 2700-A-CREATE-
      *  TCATBAL-REC, 2700-B-UPDATE-TCATBAL-REC, 2800-UPDATE-
      *  ACCOUNT-REC, 2900-WRITE-TRANSACTION-FILE, 9999-ABEND-
      *  PROGRAM).  All 5 reject codes (100, 101, 102, 103, 109)
      *  exercised.  All 4 lint gates pass; no business arithmetic.
      ******************************************************************
